{"id":58177,"date":"2026-08-09T05:39:21","date_gmt":"2026-08-09T04:39:21","guid":{"rendered":""},"modified":"2026-08-21T11:54:12","modified_gmt":"2026-08-21T10:54:12","slug":"meia-maratona-elvas-badajoz","status":"publish","type":"ajde_events","link":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/meia-maratona-elvas-badajoz\/","title":{"rendered":"Meia Maratona Elvas Badajoz 2026"},"content":{"rendered":"<p><!-- IN\u00cdCIO BLOCO REUTILIZ\u00c1VEL: CONTE\u00daDO COMPLETO MEIA MARATONA ELVAS BADAJOZ 2026 --><\/p>\n<p><!-- 1. DESCRI\u00c7\u00c3O DO EVENTO --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 style=\"font-family: 'Outfit', sans-serif; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 800; color: #FFFFFF; margin-bottom: 12px;\">\n    Sobre a <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Meia Maratona Elvas Badajoz 2026<\/span><br \/>\n  <\/h2>\n<p style=\"font-size: 14.5px; line-height: 1.7; color: #CBD5E1; margin-bottom: 0;\">\n    A Meia Maratona Internacional Elvas-Badajoz realiza-se no dia 8 de novembro de 2026 como uma das mais emblem\u00e1ticas corridas transfronteiri\u00e7as da Pen\u00ednsula Ib\u00e9rica. Na edi\u00e7\u00e3o deste ano, o percurso inverta o sentido tradicional, partindo da cidade alentejana de Elvas e terminando no cora\u00e7\u00e3o urbano de Badajoz (Espanha). Com um tra\u00e7ado regulamentar de 21,097 km, a prova une os dois pa\u00edses sobre asfalto rodativo. Prepara a tua estrat\u00e9gia na nossa <a href=\"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/calculadora\/\" style=\"color: #C4B5FD; text-decoration: underline; font-weight: 600;\" target=\"_blank\">calculadora de pace<\/a> ou explora o nosso guia de <a href=\"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/meia-maratona-distancia\/\" style=\"color: #C4B5FD; text-decoration: underline; font-weight: 600;\" target=\"_blank\">meia maratona<\/a> para gerires o ritmo na transi\u00e7\u00e3o entre Alentejo e Extremadura.\n  <\/p>\n<\/div>\n<p><!-- 2. FICHA T\u00c9CNICA \/ SNAPSHOT --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.06); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.25); border-radius: 20px; padding: 24px 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h3 style=\"font-family: 'Outfit', sans-serif; font-size: 18px; font-weight: 800; color: #FFFFFF; margin-bottom: 14px; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px;\">\n    \u26a1 Ficha T\u00e9cnica <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">\/ Snapshot<\/span><br \/>\n  <\/h3>\n<ul style=\"list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0; color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 14px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 10px;\">\n<li style=\"display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px;\"><strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF; min-width: 100px;\">\ud83d\udcc5 Data:<\/strong> <span>8 de novembro de 2026<\/span><\/li>\n<li style=\"display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px;\"><strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF; min-width: 100px;\">\ud83d\udccd Local:<\/strong> <span>Elvas (Portugal) \u2794 Avenida de Huelva, Badajoz (Espanha)<\/span><\/li>\n<li style=\"display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px;\"><strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF; min-width: 100px;\">\ud83c\udfc3 Dist\u00e2ncias:<\/strong> <span>21,097 km (Meia Maratona) e Caminhada<\/span><\/li>\n<li style=\"display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px;\"><strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF; min-width: 100px;\">\ud83d\udee3\ufe0f Piso:<\/strong> <span>Asfalto Pleno (Estrada Transfronteiri\u00e7a N4 \/ Caia)<\/span><\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<\/div>\n<p><!-- 3. GEOMETRIA DA PROVA --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h3 style=\"font-family: 'Outfit', sans-serif; font-size: 20px; font-weight: 800; color: #FFFFFF; margin-bottom: 12px; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px;\">\n    \ud83c\udfd4\ufe0f Geometria da <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Prova &amp; Percurso<\/span><br \/>\n  <\/h3>\n<p style=\"font-size: 14.5px; line-height: 1.7; color: #CBD5E1; margin-bottom: 0;\">\n    Nesta edi\u00e7\u00e3o, a corrida arranca em Elvas, descendo ligeiramente a partir da zona do est\u00e1dio municipal e rotundas de sa\u00edda da cidade em dire\u00e7\u00e3o \u00e0 estrada N4. O percurso \u00e9 plano e descendente suave ao longo da liga\u00e7\u00e3o at\u00e9 \u00e0 fronteira do Caia (km 10). Ap\u00f3s o cruzamento para territ\u00f3rio espanhol, o tra\u00e7ado segue por extensas retas de asfalto favor\u00e1veis a ritmos elevados at\u00e9 \u00e0 entrada vitoriosa nas grandes avenidas de Badajoz, culminando na linha de meta instalada na Avenida de Huelva.\n  <\/p>\n<\/div>\n<p><!-- 4. BANNER DA CALCULADORA DE PACE (CTA INTERATIVO FIXO) --><\/p>\n<style>\n  .pr-calc-event-banner { background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.08) !important; border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.25) !important; border-radius: 16px !important; padding: 18px 22px !important; margin: 24px 0 !important; display: flex !important; align-items: center !important; justify-content: space-between !important; flex-wrap: wrap !important; gap: 14px !important; font-family: 'Plus Jakarta Sans', sans-serif !important; }\n  .pr-calc-event-header { display: flex !important; align-items: center !important; gap: 8px !important; margin-bottom: 4px !important; }\n  .pr-calc-event-title { color: #FFFFFF !important; font-size: 15px !important; font-family: 'Outfit', sans-serif !important; font-weight: 700 !important; }\n  .pr-calc-event-desc { color: #94A3B8 !important; font-size: 13px !important; display: block !important; }\n  .pr-calc-event-btn { display: inline-flex !important; align-items: center !important; gap: 8px !important; background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(196, 181, 253, 0.2) 0%, rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.3) 100%) !important; border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.5) !important; color: #C4B5FD !important; font-family: 'Outfit', sans-serif !important; font-size: 13px !important; font-weight: 700 !important; padding: 10px 20px !important; border-radius: 20px !important; text-decoration: none !important; }\n<\/style>\n<div class=\"pr-calc-event-banner\">\n<div>\n<div class=\"pr-calc-event-header\">\n      <span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">\u23f1\ufe0f<\/span><br \/>\n      <span class=\"pr-calc-event-title\">Vais correr esta prova com um objetivo de tempo?<\/span>\n    <\/div>\n<p>    <span class=\"pr-calc-event-desc\">Calcula a tua estimativa de tempo final na nossa calculadora ou consulta a tabela de paces.<\/span>\n  <\/div>\n<p>  <a href=\"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/calculadora\/\" class=\"pr-calc-event-btn\">Calculadora de Pace \u2192<\/a>\n<\/div>\n<p><!-- 5. ONDE FICAR \/ ALOJAMENTO --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h3 style=\"font-family: 'Outfit', sans-serif; font-size: 20px; font-weight: 800; color: #FFFFFF; margin-bottom: 12px; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px;\">\n    \ud83c\udfe8 Onde <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Ficar em Elvas e Badajoz (Alojamento)<\/span><br \/>\n  <\/h3>\n<p style=\"font-size: 14.5px; line-height: 1.7; color: #CBD5E1; margin-bottom: 12px;\">Op\u00e7\u00f5es estrat\u00e9gicas de alojamento nas duas cidades:<\/p>\n<ul style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.7; padding-left: 20px; margin-bottom: 0;\">\n<li style=\"margin-bottom: 8px;\"><strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF;\">Elvas:<\/strong> Pousadas e hot\u00e9is no centro hist\u00f3rico fortificado (Patrim\u00f3nio Mundial UNESCO) junto ao ponto de partida.<\/li>\n<li style=\"margin-bottom: 8px;\"><strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF;\">Badajoz:<\/strong> Alojamentos urbanos perto da Avenida de Huelva para facilidade na zona de meta.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<\/div>\n<p><!-- 6. GASTRONOMIA E SOBRE O LOCAL --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h3 style=\"font-family: 'Outfit', sans-serif; font-size: 20px; font-weight: 800; color: #FFFFFF; margin-bottom: 12px; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px;\">\n    \ud83c\udf0d Sobre o Local &amp; <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Gastronomia<\/span><br \/>\n  <\/h3>\n<p style=\"font-size: 14.5px; line-height: 1.7; color: #CBD5E1; margin-bottom: 0;\">\n    Com forte liga\u00e7\u00e3o cultural, Elvas e Badajoz unem a riqueza do Alentejo e da Extremadura. Na meta em Badajoz, a celebra\u00e7\u00e3o p\u00f3s-prova inclui as tradicionais tapas espanholas, o Jam\u00f3n Ib\u00e9rico de la Dehesa e os pratos t\u00edpicos alentejanos como a A\u00e7orda e o Bacalhau \u00e0 Dourada.\n  <\/p>\n<\/div>\n<p><!-- 7. SEC\u00c7\u00c3O DE FAQS (DESIGN SYSTEM HOMEPAGE) --><\/p>\n<section class=\"pr-faq-section\" style=\"margin-top: 32px; text-align: left;\">\n<h3 style=\"font-family: 'Outfit', sans-serif; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 900; color: #FFFFFF; margin-bottom: 8px;\">\n    Perguntas <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Frequentes<\/span><br \/>\n  <\/h3>\n<p style=\"font-size: 14px; color: #94A3B8; margin-bottom: 20px;\">D\u00favidas habituais sobre a Meia Maratona Elvas Badajoz 2026.<\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-grid\">\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\">Onde posso consultar as classifica\u00e7\u00f5es e resultados da prova?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\">\n<p>Os resultados e classifica\u00e7\u00f5es oficiais ficam dispon\u00edveis na plataforma de cronometragem oficial do evento logo ap\u00f3s a valida\u00e7\u00e3o da linha de meta e s\u00e3o atualizados na p\u00e1gina do Portugal Running.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\">Onde posso ver as fotografias do evento?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\">\n<p>As fotografias do evento s\u00e3o publicadas nas redes sociais oficiais da organiza\u00e7\u00e3o e em plataformas de fotografia desportiva nas horas seguintes ao evento.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\">Onde \u00e9 a partida e onde \u00e9 a meta nesta edi\u00e7\u00e3o da prova?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\">\n<p>Nesta edi\u00e7\u00e3o, a partida realiza-se na cidade de Elvas (Portugal) e a meta est\u00e1 instalada na Avenida de Huelva, em Badajoz (Espanha).<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/details><\/div>\n<\/section>\n<p><!-- FIM BLOCO REUTILIZ\u00c1VEL --><\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":1,"featured_media":58183,"menu_order":0,"comment_status":"closed","ping_status":"closed","template":"","meta":{"_acf_changed":false},"tags":[],"event_type":[27,41],"event_type_2":[727,40,820],"event_type_3":[],"event_type_4":[],"event_type_5":[],"class_list":["post-58177","ajde_events","type-ajde_events","status-publish","has-post-thumbnail","hentry","event_location-elvas-portalegre","event_type-corrida","event_type-meiamaratona","event_type_2-lisboa-e-centro","event_type_2-portalegre","event_type